      full: "r    | OLD (val / slope) | smPow1.35 (val / slope) | smPow1.25 (val / slope) | smPowBlend0.85 (val / slope)0.00 | 0.0000 / 0.00     | 0.0000 / 0.00           | 0.0000 / 0.00           | 0.0000 / 0.000.06 | 0.0000 / 0.04     | 0.0000 / 0.00           | 0.0000 / 0.00           | 0.0000 / 0.010.15 | 0.0360 / 0.54     | 0.0052 / 0.15           | 0.0082 / 0.22           | 0.0107 / 0.220.25 | 0.1000 / 0.73     | 0.0369 / 0.50           | 0.0501 / 0.63           | 0.0487 / 0.550.50 | 0.3294 / 1.10     | 0.2939 / 1.52           | 0.3336 / 1.57           | 0.3037 / 1.460.75 | 0.6415 / 1.38     | 0.7301 / 1.74           | 0.7576 / 1.61           | 0.7194 / 1.670.85 | 0.7827 / 1.44     | 0.8870 / 1.34           | 0.9005 / 1.20           | 0.8726 / 1.340.95 | 0.9277 / 1.45     | 0.9855 / 0.56           | 0.9875 / 0.49           | 0.9770 / 0.691.00 | 1.0000 / 1.44     | 1.0000 / 0.01           | 1.0000 / 0.01           | 1.0000 / 0.22"
