  planner_response {
    response: "### Step 1 \342\200\224 Root-Cause Inspection\n\nTraced the steering pipeline end-to-end:\n\n1. **Pointer Lock & relative mouse input (`src/engine/InputManager.ts`)**: Accumulates relative `event.movementX` / `event.movementY` (only when `document.pointerLockElement === this.lockTarget`).\n2. **Reticle position & aim boundary (`src/engine/FlightController.ts`, `src/engine/AimBoundary.ts`)**: `FlightController.update` integrates `mouseDeltaX` / `mouseDeltaY` into `(joystickX, joystickY)` and clamps it onto the centered 30% \303\227 35% rounded rectangle via `clampToRoundedRect`. `evaluateVirtualJoystick` normalizes radial distance along the ray to the perimeter into $r \\in [0, 1]$ (`computeRoundedRectRayRadius`).\n3. **Response mapping (`evaluateResponseCurveScalar` in `src/engine/AimBoundary.ts`)**: Maps normalized $r$ to steering magnitude before `FlightController.update` computes `targetYawRate` / `targetPitchRate` and runs `stepAngularVelocity`.\n\n**Root cause of both symptoms** (within the piecewise curve `evaluateResponseCurveScalar` using default `deadzone = 0.06`, `responseCurve = 1.35`, `precisionSensitivity = 0.85`):\n\n- **Excessive center sensitivity:** With $u = \\frac{r - \\text{dz}}{1 - \\text{dz}}$, the previous formula $u^p (k + (1 - k)\\,\\text{smoothstep}(u))$ rose steeply immediately past the 6% deadzone (`slope = 0.405` at $r=0.10$, `0.543` at $r=0.15$, `0.728` at $r=0.25$), reaching **10.0%** of full turn rate at 25% deflection.\n- **Abrupt boundary response:** The previous curve kept accelerating up to its steepest slope (`~1.45`) in the outer band ($r = 0.85 \\to 1.00$, adding 35.8% of total turn rate between 75% and 100%) and hit the $r \\ge 1$ saturation clamp with a **C\302\271 derivative discontinuity** (left slope `1.436` dropping abruptly to `0`).\n\n---\n\n### Step 2 & 3 \342\200\224 Source Changes & Preservation\n\nModified **only** `evaluateResponseCurveScalar` in `src/engine/AimBoundary.ts`:\n\n```ts\nconst u = (radialMagnitude - dz) / Math.max(1e-5, 1 - dz);\nconst t = Math.pow(u, p);\nconst smooth = t * t * (3 - 2 * t);\nconst shaped = smooth * (k + (1 - k) * smooth);\nreturn THREE.MathUtils.clamp(shaped, 0, 1) * maxOut;\n```\n\n- **Globally $C^1$-continuous and strictly monotonic:** Derivative equals `0` at both deadzone exit ($r = \\text{dz}$) and boundary saturation ($r = 1$), eliminating any turn-rate surge or slope corner upon reaching the aim boundary while keeping full `maxSteeringInput` ($1.0$) at $r \\ge 1$.\n- **Unchanged systems:** Pointer Lock and `movementX`/`movementY` handling (`InputManager.ts`), mouse-edge continuity and rounded-rect clamping (`clampToRoundedRect`), reticle recentering (`FlightController.centerAimCursor`), aim boundary geometry and max turn rates/sensitivities (`STEERING_CONFIG`), `FlightHUD.tsx`, `CameraController.ts`, and all combat, bot, and mission systems.\n\n---\n\n### Step 4 \342\200\224 Controlled Calibration Comparison\n\nEvaluated at default parameters (`deadzone = 0.06`, `responseCurve = 1.35`, `precisionSensitivity = 0.85`, `maxSteeringInput = 1.0`):\n\n| Aim Boundary Position | Previous Output (Slope) | Refined Output (Slope) |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Center** ($r = 0.00$) | `0.0000` (`0.00`) | `0.0000` (`0.00`) |\n| **25%** ($r = 0.25$) | `0.1000` (`0.73`) | `0.0316` (`0.43`) |\n| **50%** ($r = 0.50$) | `0.3294` (`1.10`) | `0.2628` (`1.43`) |\n| **75%** ($r = 0.75$) | `0.6415` (`1.38`) | `0.7006` (`1.86`) |\n| **100%** ($r = 1.00$) | `1.0000` (`1.44` \342\206\222 `0` corner) | `1.0000` (`0.00`, $C^1$ smooth) |\n\n*(Near-center reference at $r = 0.15$: `0.0360` \342\206\222 `0.0044`; outer approach at $r = 0.95$: `0.9277` with slope `1.45` \342\206\222 `0.9834` with slope `0.64`.)*\n\n---\n\n### Verification & Test Status\n\n- **Build (`vite build`):** Passed.\n- **Type-check (`tsc --noEmit`):** Passed with zero errors.\n- **Curve & boundary continuity check (`tsx`):** Verified strict monotonicity across 10,000 samples over $r \\in [0, 1.25]$ (max step `0.000237` per $\\Delta r = 0.000125$) and continuous output across `clampToRoundedRect` + `evaluateVirtualJoystick` around the perimeter.\n- **Browser / real-mouse testing:** **Unavailable in this environment** (no browser/Chromium/Playwright binary present). Accordingly, live gameplay feel and Acceptance Tests 1\342\200\2237 remain **unverified in an actual browser with a real mouse** and require interactive testing in the running app."
    thinking: "**Verifying Browser Availability**\n\nI\'m confirming the absence of a browser or mouse test harness in this sandbox environment. Running `which chromium google-chrome playwright` explicitly, I found nothing. The `which` command returned 1, meaning the sandbox does not contain those components. This confirms that real browser testing is not possible at this time per the prompt\'s requirements.\n\n\n**Confirming Unverified Implementation**\n\nI must be upfront: the implementation\'s verification remains incomplete. Mathematical simulations alone cannot validate successful gameplay. I am committed to complete transparency on this point. I have reviewed everything, ensuring the final report is accurate, technical, and covers all reporting points, including Steps 1-4. The root cause analysis traced from `InputManager.handleMouseMove` to `FlightController.update`, pinpointing `evaluateResponseCurveScalar` as the mapping function within `src/engine/AimBoundary.ts`. The original curve\'s steepness caused the initial rotation issue.\n\n\n**Analyzing Curve Adjustments**\n\nI\'ve been looking closely at the recent curve adjustments. The new configuration details yaw rate at various radii:  10% of full turn rate at 0.10, rising to 0.728 at 0.25. The root cause for abrupt acceleration has been traced to the original piecewise curve reaching max slope too quickly in the outer band and then terminating with a derivative discontinuity. The changes were localized to `evaluateResponseCurveScalar` in `AimBoundary.ts` specifically, with the equations related to `t`, `smooth`, and `shaped`.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "3Dz_ao6xK-2LqtsPkbm8qQk"
    modified_response: "### Step 1 \342\200\224 Root-Cause Inspection\n\nTraced the steering pipeline end-to-end:\n\n1. **Pointer Lock & relative mouse input (`src/engine/InputManager.ts`)**: Accumulates relative `event.movementX` / `event.movementY` (only when `document.pointerLockElement === this.lockTarget`).\n2. **Reticle position & aim boundary (`src/engine/FlightController.ts`, `src/engine/AimBoundary.ts`)**: `FlightController.update` integrates `mouseDeltaX` / `mouseDeltaY` into `(joystickX, joystickY)` and clamps it onto the centered 30% \303\227 35% rounded rectangle via `clampToRoundedRect`. `evaluateVirtualJoystick` normalizes radial distance along the ray to the perimeter into $r \\in [0, 1]$ (`computeRoundedRectRayRadius`).\n3. **Response mapping (`evaluateResponseCurveScalar` in `src/engine/AimBoundary.ts`)**: Maps normalized $r$ to steering magnitude before `FlightController.update` computes `targetYawRate` / `targetPitchRate` and runs `stepAngularVelocity`.\n\n**Root cause of both symptoms** (within the piecewise curve `evaluateResponseCurveScalar` using default `deadzone = 0.06`, `responseCurve = 1.35`, `precisionSensitivity = 0.85`):\n\n- **Excessive center sensitivity:** With $u = \\frac{r - \\text{dz}}{1 - \\text{dz}}$, the previous formula $u^p (k + (1 - k)\\,\\text{smoothstep}(u))$ rose steeply immediately past the 6% deadzone (`slope = 0.405` at $r=0.10$, `0.543` at $r=0.15$, `0.728` at $r=0.25$), reaching **10.0%** of full turn rate at 25% deflection.\n- **Abrupt boundary response:** The previous curve kept accelerating up to its steepest slope (`~1.45`) in the outer band ($r = 0.85 \\to 1.00$, adding 35.8% of total turn rate between 75% and 100%) and hit the $r \\ge 1$ saturation clamp with a **C\302\271 derivative discontinuity** (left slope `1.436` dropping abruptly to `0`).\n\n---\n\n### Step 2 & 3 \342\200\224 Source Changes & Preservation\n\nModified **only** `evaluateResponseCurveScalar` in `src/engine/AimBoundary.ts`:\n\n```ts\nconst u = (radialMagnitude - dz) / Math.max(1e-5, 1 - dz);\nconst t = Math.pow(u, p);\nconst smooth = t * t * (3 - 2 * t);\nconst shaped = smooth * (k + (1 - k) * smooth);\nreturn THREE.MathUtils.clamp(shaped, 0, 1) * maxOut;\n```\n\n- **Globally $C^1$-continuous and strictly monotonic:** Derivative equals `0` at both deadzone exit ($r = \\text{dz}$) and boundary saturation ($r = 1$), eliminating any turn-rate surge or slope corner upon reaching the aim boundary while keeping full `maxSteeringInput` ($1.0$) at $r \\ge 1$.\n- **Unchanged systems:** Pointer Lock and `movementX`/`movementY` handling (`InputManager.ts`), mouse-edge continuity and rounded-rect clamping (`clampToRoundedRect`), reticle recentering (`FlightController.centerAimCursor`), aim boundary geometry and max turn rates/sensitivities (`STEERING_CONFIG`), `FlightHUD.tsx`, `CameraController.ts`, and all combat, bot, and mission systems.\n\n---\n\n### Step 4 \342\200\224 Controlled Calibration Comparison\n\nEvaluated at default parameters (`deadzone = 0.06`, `responseCurve = 1.35`, `precisionSensitivity = 0.85`, `maxSteeringInput = 1.0`):\n\n| Aim Boundary Position | Previous Output (Slope) | Refined Output (Slope) |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Center** ($r = 0.00$) | `0.0000` (`0.00`) | `0.0000` (`0.00`) |\n| **25%** ($r = 0.25$) | `0.1000` (`0.73`) | `0.0316` (`0.43`) |\n| **50%** ($r = 0.50$) | `0.3294` (`1.10`) | `0.2628` (`1.43`) |\n| **75%** ($r = 0.75$) | `0.6415` (`1.38`) | `0.7006` (`1.86`) |\n| **100%** ($r = 1.00$) | `1.0000` (`1.44` \342\206\222 `0` corner) | `1.0000` (`0.00`, $C^1$ smooth) |\n\n*(Near-center reference at $r = 0.15$: `0.0360` \342\206\222 `0.0044`; outer approach at $r = 0.95$: `0.9277` with slope `1.45` \342\206\222 `0.9834` with slope `0.64`.)*\n\n---\n\n### Verification & Test Status\n\n- **Build (`vite build`):** Passed.\n- **Type-check (`tsc --noEmit`):** Passed with zero errors.\n- **Curve & boundary continuity check (`tsx`):** Verified strict monotonicity across 10,000 samples over $r \\in [0, 1.25]$ (max step `0.000237` per $\\Delta r = 0.000125$) and continuous output across `clampToRoundedRect` + `evaluateVirtualJoystick` around the perimeter.\n- **Browser / real-mouse testing:** **Unavailable in this environment** (no browser/Chromium/Playwright binary present). Accordingly, live gameplay feel and Acceptance Tests 1\342\200\2237 remain **unverified in an actual browser with a real mouse** and require interactive testing in the running app."
